Description: development files and documentation for libcurl (OpenSSL flavour)
 libcurl is an easy-to-use client-side URL transfer library.
 .
 This package provides the development files (includes, pkg-config file,
 curl-config, manual pages) for building software that uses libcurl.
 .
 Percona build of libcurl 8.23.0 for Percona Distribution for PostgreSQL.
